WEBVTT

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:07.360
My name is Madarame Harunobu.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:09.970
I graduated Shiiiou University 
with a major in economics.

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:14.990
Now I'm a salaryman who works for 
a sewer construction company.

00:00:15.440 --> 00:00:18.870
When I was a student, I loved being an otaku.

00:00:19.360 --> 00:00:23.270
I'd sworn to stay one my whole life, but...

00:00:26.700 --> 00:00:32.170
You know... being an adult is exhausting.

00:00:42.300 --> 00:00:43.390
Huh?

00:00:43.690 --> 00:00:46.790
It's all clean. And I can see the floor.

00:00:46.790 --> 00:00:50.860
Did Hato-kun do this? That was nice of her.

00:00:51.320 --> 00:00:54.660
Or was it just too dirty for her to handle.

00:00:55.260 --> 00:00:57.800
The games and books are sorted perfectly.

00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:07.350
It's safe.

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:51.580
The club room feels kind of different now.

00:02:52.200 --> 00:02:56.440
I guess that can't be helped. 
It's mostly girls now.

00:02:56.980 --> 00:02:59.060
Back then...

00:03:02.360 --> 00:03:03.890
And then...

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:16.740
Um...

00:03:17.350 --> 00:03:18.740
Watanabe?

00:03:17.610 --> 00:03:18.880
Madarame!

00:03:18.880 --> 00:03:22.240
Oh crap! Oh crap! Oh crap! That scared me.

00:03:22.240 --> 00:03:23.890
How could I confuse those two?

00:03:23.890 --> 00:03:26.200
There's only one person here?

00:03:26.200 --> 00:03:27.850
Yeah.

00:03:27.850 --> 00:03:30.850
What? I wanted to see the new girls.

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:31.800
Huh?

00:03:31.800 --> 00:03:36.240
What? I, Sasahara Keiko,
 am a member of Genshiken too.

00:03:36.240 --> 00:03:41.090
I'm former president Sasahara's little sister,
 and the president's future sister-in-law.

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:43.820
Isn't that a great position to be in?

00:03:43.820 --> 00:03:47.500
Even if it's kind of weird that the 
last two presidents are dating.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:51.810
Sasahara was the president two generations 
ago. The last one was Ohno-san.

00:03:52.230 --> 00:03:55.360
Come back in the evening.
 Not many people come during the day.

00:03:55.360 --> 00:03:58.980
And it's in the evening when the 
really interesting girl comes.

00:03:58.980 --> 00:03:59.820
What's she like?

00:03:59.820 --> 00:04:00.410
Huh?

00:04:03.010 --> 00:04:05.100
Daydream Believer

00:04:05.350 --> 00:04:08.750
It doesn't matter.
 It's just Genshiken, right?

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:12.790
I just happened to get up early because 
I had yesterday off from work.

00:04:12.790 --> 00:04:13.750
Work?

00:04:13.750 --> 00:04:15.380
I'm a cabaret girl in Hachiouji.

00:04:16.730 --> 00:04:18.670
Ask for me sometime.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:22.710
<b>Kyouko</b>

00:04:21.650 --> 00:04:22.710
What?

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:25.700
Um, I don't go to those places anyway.

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:28.650
Jeez, she really doesn't belong here!

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:30.160
Anyway...

00:04:30.160 --> 00:04:34.140
It's boring now that Kousaka 
and Saki-neesan have graduated.

00:04:34.980 --> 00:04:36.030
Do they ever come?

00:04:36.030 --> 00:04:39.010
I saw them a little at the welcome party,

00:04:39.010 --> 00:04:42.000
but they never come to the club room.

00:04:42.000 --> 00:04:46.580
I see. If Saki-neesan doesn't come,
 then why do you, Watanabe?

00:04:46.580 --> 00:04:48.020
What do you do?

00:04:48.360 --> 00:04:49.950
It's Madarame.

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:58.440
What are you talking about?

00:04:58.440 --> 00:05:01.470
It doesn't matter to me that 
Kasukabe-san doesn't come anymore.

00:05:01.470 --> 00:05:04.610
That's what you say, after that long pause?

00:05:04.610 --> 00:05:09.910
No point in hiding it now, is there?
 You liked Saki-neesan.

00:05:11.050 --> 00:05:14.430
I don't understand.
 What are you talking about?

00:05:16.000 --> 00:05:18.540
Listen, it was obvious!

00:05:18.540 --> 00:05:20.480
Completely obvious!

00:05:20.820 --> 00:05:23.770
Seriously, I can't believe you 
thought no one could tell.

00:05:23.770 --> 00:05:25.860
Onee-chan and Ohno-chan 
were saying the same thing.

00:05:26.380 --> 00:05:29.240
Which means her boyfriend knows too!

00:05:29.360 --> 00:05:32.540
And my brother and that guy with the topknot!

00:05:32.850 --> 00:05:38.060
And I haven't asked, but I'm 
sure Saki-neesan noticed it too.

00:05:44.300 --> 00:05:47.740
I... I have no idea what 
you're talking about!

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:50.420
Man you piss me off!

00:05:50.420 --> 00:05:52.730
Can otaku not even talk about romance?

00:05:52.730 --> 00:05:56.190
Romance? I've never had any 
romance in my entire life!

00:05:56.190 --> 00:05:59.600
It's been otaku talk for me my entire life!
 I'm a natural born otaku!

00:05:59.600 --> 00:06:03.530
So in other words you have no 
friends? I see! Sorry for asking!

00:06:03.530 --> 00:06:06.700
Shut up! Go back to your cabaret 
and let some old man feel you up!

00:06:06.700 --> 00:06:10.580
You idiot! A cabaret isn't a brothel! 
Do you not even know the difference?

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:18.360
Would you two just stay 
like that for a second?

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:21.980
I'll go to the store and get an awl,
 a penknife, and a pot lid--

00:06:22.000 --> 00:06:24.460
No one's gonna get that. Don't force it.

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:26.320
A foreigner?

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:29.160
One of the new kids. Susanna Hopkins.

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:32.990
Huh... forget it, I'm tired. Later.

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:35.160
Yeah, get outta here.

00:06:35.880 --> 00:06:38.460
You haven't given up, have you?

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:42.150
That's why you're still wasting 
your life in this room.

00:06:44.590 --> 00:06:45.420
Right.

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:48.820
Try asking somebody out in 
real life for once, otaku.

00:06:53.210 --> 00:06:57.440
A-Anyway, I have to get to work...

00:06:57.440 --> 00:07:01.650
There's a way to move forward without 
giving up on your last love.

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:04.000
Huh?

00:07:04.870 --> 00:07:07.400
Find a new love.

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:11.100
Funz!

00:07:11.100 --> 00:07:14.240
No, I don't think I'm going 
to get into that stuff.

00:07:14.240 --> 00:07:16.870
Hey there! Oh, Sue-san's here.

00:07:16.870 --> 00:07:17.660
Yo.

00:07:17.880 --> 00:07:19.600
Hello there, Madarame-sempai.

00:07:19.650 --> 00:07:23.060
Hi there. Uh, you're just arriving now?

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:24.540
Isn't your lunch break going to end soon?

00:07:24.540 --> 00:07:28.290
We've got the afternoon off, so I was 
thinking of taking the freshmen to Ikebukuro.

00:07:30.010 --> 00:07:31.950
Hato-chan especially was excited.

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:36.990
"I'll go change right now," she said. 
She's probably changing at your place.

00:07:37.270 --> 00:07:39.540
She's never been to Otome Road, she says.

00:07:40.110 --> 00:07:43.860
I see. Anyway, I'm heading back to work.

00:07:43.860 --> 00:07:45.030
Bye!

00:07:45.030 --> 00:07:46.420
Bye.

00:08:02.370 --> 00:08:05.120
So all the freshmen went?

00:08:05.120 --> 00:08:06.310
Supposedly.

00:08:06.310 --> 00:08:09.040
I guess working as assistants helped.

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:09.760
Huh?

00:08:09.760 --> 00:08:13.820
Working together toward a goal 
makes you feel more like a team.

00:08:15.230 --> 00:08:17.580
I'm very grateful, myself.

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:19.440
You staying on schedule?

00:08:19.440 --> 00:08:20.710
Yeah, thanks to you guys.

00:08:20.710 --> 00:08:25.160
Once a bit more of the draft is ready, 
I'll need some more of your help.

00:08:25.900 --> 00:08:28.300
Sounds good to me!

00:08:32.740 --> 00:08:33.550
Huh?

00:08:34.510 --> 00:08:39.340
Did I forget to turn the lights off?
 Or is that Hato-kun...?

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:42.810
She's never been here at this hour.

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:51.940
I'm sorry. I just came to get my stuff.

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:57.470
Um, well... we went to Ikebukuro today.

00:08:57.470 --> 00:09:02.310
And I couldn't get a bag ready for 
all the stuff I was planning to buy,

00:09:02.310 --> 00:09:07.550
So I left my clothes and makeup here 
and took my changing bag with me,

00:09:07.550 --> 00:09:09.340
And I came back to pick up my things,

00:09:09.340 --> 00:09:11.290
but I couldn't control myself, 
so I read a doujinshi...

00:09:11.290 --> 00:09:15.800
It was one I really wanted and it was short, 
so I thought it wouldn't take long, but...

00:09:18.880 --> 00:09:21.390
Was Ikebukuro fun?

00:09:25.550 --> 00:09:27.920
Yes. Very.

00:09:27.920 --> 00:09:32.050
That's good. You can come 
here whenever you like.

00:09:32.050 --> 00:09:36.670
You were the one who cleaned my 
room up, right? I can't complain.

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:38.510
I'm sorry for not asking first.

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:42.210
You're nice enough to let me use it all the time,
 so I thought it was the least I could do.

00:09:42.210 --> 00:09:44.430
Don't worry about it.

00:09:44.690 --> 00:09:46.610
Wow, you did buy a lot.

00:09:47.120 --> 00:09:48.850
I'll get it out of here right now!

00:09:48.850 --> 00:09:49.690
Can you carry it all?

00:09:49.690 --> 00:09:50.940
I'll be fine!

00:09:52.290 --> 00:09:53.630
Okay!

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:56.320
Want to have something to drink first?

00:09:58.700 --> 00:10:02.850
I haven't had enough yet, 
so I bought some beer.

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.050
Um...

00:10:08.830 --> 00:10:11.710
I'm sorry, I want to read these 
as soon as physically possible!

00:10:11.710 --> 00:10:15.430
Sorry. Of course you do. Of course...

00:10:16.210 --> 00:10:17.520
Good night!

00:10:17.520 --> 00:10:19.310
Take care.

00:10:27.110 --> 00:10:30.770
What was I doing just now?!

00:10:33.670 --> 00:10:35.790
It smells kind of good now...

00:10:51.270 --> 00:10:55.410
So that's how you finished your last draft?

00:10:55.410 --> 00:10:57.170
With a ton of assistants.

00:10:57.170 --> 00:10:59.460
Just like a professional. 
An asshole professional!

00:10:59.460 --> 00:11:01.530
I am a professional, I guess...

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:06.600
And I paid them too, so I don't 
see why you're complaining.

00:11:07.250 --> 00:11:09.200
So when's it coming out?

00:11:09.200 --> 00:11:11.370
At the end of the month.

00:11:12.980 --> 00:11:14.920
It doesn't matter!

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:17.330
What about the draft for Comic Festival?

00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:21.280
If you miss the deadline 'cause you have to 
finish your pro work, I'm gonna be really mad!

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:24.460
We stopped work on Yabuhebi and helped you

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:27.390
'cause you said you were going to make a 
book to celebrate Fullmetal Sorcerer finishing!

00:11:27.390 --> 00:11:29.680
I never asked for your help, though.

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:31.120
What was that?

00:11:31.420 --> 00:11:34.570
A-As your partner, I need you to do your job!

00:11:34.570 --> 00:11:36.200
Partner? Since when?

00:11:41.710 --> 00:11:46.200
Well, I don't even have a draft ready for 
Comic Festival, so I know why you're worried.

00:11:46.310 --> 00:11:51.280
But once summer break comes I can 
spend all day on it. It'll be fine.

00:11:51.280 --> 00:11:54.780
If you absolutely insist, I could help you.

00:11:54.780 --> 00:11:57.170
I can't hear you, sempai!

00:11:57.170 --> 00:11:58.570
It's tsundere time!

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:00.990
Get lost, you two!

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:05.470
The freshmen are more of 
a help than I thought.

00:12:06.180 --> 00:12:07.660
The freshmen?

00:12:07.710 --> 00:12:09.930
Yeah, Hato-kun especially.

00:12:10.130 --> 00:12:11.800
It's hot...

00:12:12.630 --> 00:12:15.480
Did Genshiken pick up another dude?

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:17.940
Sorry, I got that wrong. Hato-san.

00:12:19.960 --> 00:12:21.880
And this weighs a ton...

00:12:22.140 --> 00:12:26.340
I wonder if I could just leave the makeup 
in Madarame-sempai's room..

00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:29.230
No, I can't take advantage of him any more.

00:12:39.130 --> 00:12:42.900
That's right. It's better 
to be slightly hesitant.

00:12:42.900 --> 00:12:45.670
Like you just can't get used to it.

00:12:45.730 --> 00:12:50.330
Look at this from the outside.
 It's totally Hato x Mada!

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:53.410
But what am I, exactly?

00:12:53.410 --> 00:12:55.620
A geppledonger? Your second self?

00:12:55.620 --> 00:12:58.510
A spiritual entity?
 A figment of your imagination?

00:12:58.510 --> 00:13:01.460
Your Stand? Or your <i>tokatonton</i>? {These are references to things. Tokatonton is a Dazai Osamu book, for instance. Geppledonger is from Sayonara Zetsubou-sensei.}{Tokatonton is a sound effect in the story, so I tried to format it as such.}

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:10.280
Sempai gave me permission 
to use the air conditioner.

00:13:10.750 --> 00:13:14.310
Otherwise I'd be too sweaty 
to change or put on makeup.

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:20.380
He never cleans up his room! Silly sempai.

00:13:20.890 --> 00:13:23.330
"Silly sempai!" I said!

00:13:23.330 --> 00:13:27.250
After this I'll say,
 "Sempai couldn't survive without my help."

00:13:27.250 --> 00:13:29.690
You need to help out your sempai!

00:13:29.690 --> 00:13:33.790
It's good when the younger one is on top!

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:37.560
<b>High School Girls Out of Control</b>

00:13:34.550 --> 00:13:37.730
Oh sempai, put your doujinshi away!

00:13:37.930 --> 00:13:40.170
And you didn't wash the dishes...

00:13:40.470 --> 00:13:42.840
Oh my, Madarame-sempai!

00:13:42.840 --> 00:13:47.780
But this carelessness and vulnerability 
makes him an ideal bottom!

00:13:49.130 --> 00:13:51.760
I guess using his shower 
is taking it a bit too far.

00:13:51.810 --> 00:13:53.640
The shower?

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:55.790
What kind of flag is that going to trigger?

00:13:55.790 --> 00:13:59.690
If there's no special event where he 
comes home while I'm in the shower,

00:13:59.690 --> 00:14:02.670
the player will be pissed!

00:14:03.950 --> 00:14:05.050
It's cool.

00:14:20.520 --> 00:14:23.790
Good job me! I want to 
pat myself on the back!

00:14:23.790 --> 00:14:25.200
I know what happens now!

00:14:25.200 --> 00:14:29.800
I fall asleep, surrounded by his scent, 
and then he finds me when he gets home.

00:14:29.800 --> 00:14:33.680
And then only two things can happen!
 One: He makes his move while I'm asleep!

00:14:33.680 --> 00:14:36.310
Two: I pretend to be asleep and jump him!

00:14:36.310 --> 00:14:40.060
And since it's Hato x Mada, 
the choice must be...

00:14:40.060 --> 00:14:42.620
Kissy-kissy rub-rub!

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:46.940
Hato-kun?

00:14:48.220 --> 00:14:50.950
Hato-kun! Hato-kun!

00:14:51.970 --> 00:14:52.880
Huh?

00:14:52.880 --> 00:14:56.200
Good morning. Or good evening.

00:14:56.210 --> 00:14:58.060
Did you fall asleep?

00:15:01.370 --> 00:15:04.460
I'll leave right away! I'm sorry!

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:04.790
You don't have to rush...

00:15:04.790 --> 00:15:07.890
Huh? Did I really fall asleep?

00:15:07.890 --> 00:15:12.820
I laid down just a second ago... Was I dreaming?
 When did it start? Am I dreaming now?

00:15:14.560 --> 00:15:15.980
Hato-kun?

00:15:16.680 --> 00:15:20.090
Calm down, Hato-kun.
 I don't think you're awake yet.

00:15:20.090 --> 00:15:21.670
Y-Yeah...

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:35.680
This beer is great. So good!

00:15:35.680 --> 00:15:39.480
No, um... this is really good too.

00:15:39.480 --> 00:15:44.300
Glad to hear it. That's shrimp, 
ham, and cherry tomato pasta.

00:15:44.300 --> 00:15:47.110
Sometimes when you live alone you 
want to make something decent.

00:15:47.840 --> 00:15:50.500
What is this strange sense of defeat?

00:15:51.130 --> 00:15:55.700
He can't be good at this! Character-wise 
it should be the reverse! And I can't cook!

00:15:56.480 --> 00:16:00.540
He lets somebody like me into his 
room, and even cooks for me...

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:02.420
What is he thinking?

00:16:03.060 --> 00:16:06.680
Wait a second... could it be Mada x Hato?

00:16:07.400 --> 00:16:12.160
Well, you know. I need to make friends 
with the only guy left in the club right now.

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:16.320
It's hard to hang out in the club room,
 with all the girls there now.

00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:19.460
Oh, but I'm a girl when I'm there.

00:16:19.460 --> 00:16:21.760
That's true, yeah.

00:16:22.090 --> 00:16:24.440
Maybe I've read too much BL.

00:16:24.440 --> 00:16:28.410
Actually, I've never met you 
when you're a guy before.

00:16:28.410 --> 00:16:30.100
It's Hato-kun, right?

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:33.480
Sure, I'm Hato.

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:35.560
Just a second.

00:16:38.670 --> 00:16:40.960
Hello, Madarame-san.

00:16:41.930 --> 00:16:45.490
That scared me! You really do change.

00:16:45.490 --> 00:16:47.350
You sounded like Noumi Yamiko.

00:16:47.350 --> 00:16:49.470
I liked it when you said my name.

00:16:48.020 --> 00:16:51.020
No, my voice isn't that nice.

00:16:51.030 --> 00:16:53.470
I think anybody could do it 
if they put the effort in.

00:16:53.770 --> 00:16:56.360
I learned from books and the internet.

00:16:56.360 --> 00:17:01.330
The internet? I mean, sure... but 
it still takes a lot of time right?

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:03.830
It took me about three months.

00:17:03.830 --> 00:17:06.100
I don't have that kind of energy.

00:17:06.780 --> 00:17:11.610
He treates me like I'm normal, 
whether I'm a girl or a guy.

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:17.110
If you're that good, you can fit in with 
all the girls at Genshiken perfectly right?

00:17:17.110 --> 00:17:19.030
Oh, I don't know.

00:17:19.030 --> 00:17:22.720
Yajima-san's pretty persistent 
about telling me to stop.

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:24.330
Is she?

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:28.780
Yeah. She wants me to go as a guy. 
I can understand why, I guess.

00:17:29.100 --> 00:17:32.620
It must be a little creepy.

00:17:35.740 --> 00:17:39.730
I'd like to make something clear, I guess.

00:17:39.730 --> 00:17:41.470
What?

00:17:41.470 --> 00:17:44.950
It's not that I'm into other guys...

00:17:50.890 --> 00:17:53.280
Aren't you surprised?

00:17:53.280 --> 00:17:55.860
I thought that was pretty shocking myself.

00:17:55.860 --> 00:17:59.690
Sorry! I'd only ever thought 
of BL or crossdressing

00:17:59.690 --> 00:18:03.040
as something you did as a hobby.

00:18:03.840 --> 00:18:07.940
Then didn't you think 
something bad might happen

00:18:08.170 --> 00:18:10.400
if you let a weirdo like me into 
your room and gave me food?

00:18:10.400 --> 00:18:13.560
Something bad? Like you're going to rob me?

00:18:15.230 --> 00:18:16.380
No...

00:18:16.380 --> 00:18:18.500
I think you've been reading too much BL.

00:18:18.500 --> 00:18:22.130
No, I mean... you're right, but...

00:18:22.360 --> 00:18:26.130
If I really was into that stuff,

00:18:26.130 --> 00:18:29.960
I should have fallen in love with you by now.

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:36.090
Oh, that's it.

00:18:36.090 --> 00:18:41.070
Actually, since you were dressed like a guy,
 I felt really relaxed while talking to you.

00:18:41.070 --> 00:18:45.170
He doesn't seem scared at all. He...

00:18:48.630 --> 00:18:49.400
Uh?

00:18:49.400 --> 00:18:51.540
He really is careless and vulnerable.

00:18:51.960 --> 00:18:52.770
What?

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:56.280
No. It's nothing. Thank you.

00:18:56.280 --> 00:18:58.750
What? Are we done with that subject?

00:18:58.750 --> 00:19:00.840
Yes. Thank you.

00:19:00.840 --> 00:19:03.810
You sure? I've barely said a word.

00:19:03.810 --> 00:19:08.080
I'm sure. Now let's eat! Have another beer.

00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:11.040
Yeah, you're right.

00:19:32.260 --> 00:19:36.970
He left his glasses on... 
should I take them off?

00:19:36.970 --> 00:19:38.340
Take them off and give him a kiss!

00:19:38.340 --> 00:19:39.550
Be quiet. Shut up!

00:19:39.550 --> 00:19:42.490
Why? He's totally open!

00:19:42.490 --> 00:19:44.200
I don't want to wake him.

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:46.990
And I'm not into that stuff, personally.

00:19:46.990 --> 00:19:50.090
After all that fapping to BL you do?

00:19:50.090 --> 00:19:51.810
Don't say "fap".

00:19:52.640 --> 00:19:55.670
Something fell behind the shelves.

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:08.280
Pictures?

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:17.630
They're all...

00:20:18.470 --> 00:20:20.070
They're all...

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:30.700
Madarame-sempai likes Kasukabe-sempai?

00:20:32.070 --> 00:20:33.420
Affairs are so hot!

00:20:33.420 --> 00:20:37.430
Shut up! You don't know 
what a man's heart is like!

00:20:37.430 --> 00:20:42.510
T-That's insulting! I'm you, after all!

00:22:26.990 --> 00:22:30.010
<b>Cosplay Day</b>

00:22:30.640 --> 00:22:33.120
Kyouko, are you really doing that?

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:35.620
<b>Kyouko (Real name:  Sasahara Keiko)</b>

00:22:33.120 --> 00:22:35.620
Yup, sure am!

00:22:35.620 --> 00:22:37.930
We've got a bunny girl, a 
nurse, and a high school girl.

00:22:37.930 --> 00:22:41.200
And a miniskirt police officer.
 So what's one more?

00:22:41.200 --> 00:22:42.720
There's a lot of demand for them.

00:22:42.720 --> 00:22:45.560
I need to go all out or I won't survive.

00:22:45.560 --> 00:22:50.170
This is really popular at pachinko, and there 
are even celebrities who imitate it!

00:22:50.170 --> 00:22:52.930
I think it might be pretty popular!

00:22:52.930 --> 00:22:53.730
Not happening.

00:22:53.730 --> 00:22:57.430
But manager, this was expensive! 
I bought it myself!

00:22:57.430 --> 00:23:00.850
We don't do that stuff here. 
Do it on your own time.

00:23:00.850 --> 00:23:02.860
What if we get sued?

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:07.490
Damn it. If Watanabe came, 
I'm sure he'd love it.

00:23:07.490 --> 00:23:09.990
<b>Genshiken Second Generation</b>

00:23:09.990 --> 00:23:14.490
<b>Preview</b>

00:23:10.520 --> 00:23:12.050
It's almost time for Comic Festival!

00:23:12.050 --> 00:23:14.490
Let's buy all the BL books we can find!

00:23:14.490 --> 00:23:16.070
I hope there's some last minute stuff too! {The word she uses, toppatsubon, is for stuff made at the last second and printed on copy machines.}

00:23:16.070 --> 00:23:17.600
I'm so excited I can't sleep!

00:23:17.600 --> 00:23:20.580
Not getting enough sleep is bad for 
your skin and can lead to heatstroke!

00:23:20.580 --> 00:23:23.080
Yoshitake-san gave us a list 
of stuff to beat the heat.

00:23:23.080 --> 00:23:26.090
Hat. Towel. Fan. Suntan lotion. Deodorant.

00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:28.070
Napkins to wipe off the sweat.  
Change of clothes. Frozen drinks.

00:23:28.070 --> 00:23:29.240
What great ideas!

00:23:29.470 --> 00:23:33.680
Lastly, if you put an ice pack in your bra, 
it keeps you cool and gives you big boobs!

00:23:34.390 --> 00:23:35.500
That one's not happening.

00:23:35.500 --> 00:23:36.570
Yeah.

00:23:36.570 --> 00:23:40.030
Next time on <i>Genshiken: Second Generation:</i> 
Beards and Boobs!
